sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as Message router
    participant Run as Agent runner
    participant CP as checkpointing_db
    participant MW as Summarization middleware
    participant S as Summarizer model
    participant M as Chat model
    participant DB as conversations

    R->>Run: generate (conversation_id, message_id)
    Run->>CP: aget_tuple(thread_id)
    alt checkpoint exists
        Note over Run: send the new message only
    else checkpoint expired
        Note over Run: seed every stored turn,<br/>then the new message
    end
    Run->>CP: graph loads the thread, appends the message
    loop every model call in the turn
        Note over MW: apply _summarization_event<br/>(summary + tail)
        opt tokens over 85% of the window
            MW->>S: older messages (arguments already cut)
            S-->>MW: summary, at most 2,000 tokens
            MW->>CP: new _summarization_event
        end
        MW->>M: summary message + kept tail
        M-->>Run: tool call or answer
    end
    Run-->>R: answer streamed and stored
    Run-)CP: aget_state (background task)
    CP--)Run: summary text, first id, last id
    Run-)DB: save summary when it changed
